  "goodToKnow": "Die Regulierung is regulation: die Regulierung der Finanzmärkte, die Regulierung von künstlicher Intelligenz (the EU's AI Act). Germany's main market regulator is the Bundesnetzagentur, which covers electricity, gas, telecoms, post and rail. Business groups often complain about Überregulierung (over-regulation) and Bürokratie. Regulieren also means to adjust: die Temperatur regulieren. Plural: die Regulierungen."
